mapping "V5072.1" source="V5072" target="214206004" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V5072 (Swedish ICD-10-SE) = SNOMED CT 214206004. This is the Swedish 7th-character
        activity-context extension of base ICD-10 V50.7 (Athena concept 45566028). The activity
        qualifier (work/sport/etc.) has no SNOMED CT analogue — it is contextual metadata, orthogonal to
        the accident mechanism. Target SNOMED CT 442451 = (214206004) is the verified Athena crosswalk
        target of parent V50.7. Target subsumes the accident concept; the dropped activity dimension is
        metadata, not core clinical meaning. high: one-level broader (activity qualifier dropped),
        crosswalk verified via parent V50.7 in Athena ICD10 relationships.tdl. No web research used.
        """
}
